{"name":"photogrammetry","steps":14,"labels":["where the photographs were taken","the photographs","points triangulated"],"timeLabel":"photographs taken","note":"Each photograph is only a photograph. Structure from motion recovers where they were taken by matching features between them, then multi-view stereo triangulates each surface point from the images that can see it - so a point needs at least 3 unobstructed views before it exists at all. Surfaces only, no interior ever, and only where there is texture to match: shiny, clear or plain gives nothing. The colour in panel 3 is the one thing here that was measured rather than chosen - it comes straight off the photographs, which no other method on these slides gives you.","geometry":{"eye":[[1.92571,0.55,0.70294],[1.43001,0.97584,1.46886],[0.65108,0.27466,1.94386],[-0.2568,0.30219,2.03385],[-1.11383,0.98556,1.72101],[-1.75024,0.51618,1.06731],[-2.04,0.1363,0.20221],[-1.92571,0.85131,-0.70294],[-1.43001,0.76888,-1.46886],[-0.65108,0.10717,-1.94386],[0.2568,0.61744,-2.03385],[1.11383,0.94922,-1.72101],[1.75024,0.22443,-1.06731],[2.04,0.36129,-0.20221]]},"readout":["1 of 14 photographs \u00b7 0 points triangulated","2 of 14 photographs \u00b7 0 points triangulated","3 of 14 photographs \u00b7 189 points triangulated","4 of 14 photographs \u00b7 361 points triangulated","5 of 14 photographs \u00b7 665 points triangulated","6 of 14 photographs \u00b7 869 points triangulated","7 of 14 photographs \u00b7 1 054 points triangulated","8 of 14 photographs \u00b7 1 332 points triangulated","9 of 14 photographs \u00b7 1 562 points triangulated","10 of 14 photographs \u00b7 1 714 points triangulated","11 of 14 photographs \u00b7 1 977 points triangulated","12 of 14 photographs \u00b7 2 325 points triangulated","13 of 14 photographs \u00b7 2 474 points triangulated","14 of 14 photographs \u00b7 2 563 points triangulated"],"minViews":3,"candidates":2563,"frames":{"file":"frames.png","cols":4,"tile":[292,140],"channels":3},"panel3"